# Nightly credential presence and expiry for the dashboard's Health page
# (sd:2203): `sd-db.sh credentials` probes the GitHub PAT, gh, HA_TOKEN and
# the MCP servers, and records facts only, never a value. It runs after
# ~/.config/shell/env.sh, so it sees the tokens a shell sees. 03:10, past the
# 02:xx slot, since the probes need the network (.claude/rules/cron-wake.md).
JOB_SCHEDULE="10 3 * * *"
JOB_COMMAND="\"$ROOT/../local-sd-db/sd-db.sh\" credentials"
